motional nuance to life,<br>while high-quality CG sets the stage for tense interrogations and shocking punishments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/97238411503eb6ca39cd2fb7a406dbb8.avif?t=1766400754\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras_big/97238411503eb6ca39cd2fb7a406dbb8.avif?t=1766400754 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the culprit is revealed, they will face a punishment shaped by their own cognitive disorder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world consumed by distorted perceptions, will you uncover the real truth?</strong><br><i>Psycho-Sleuth</i> invites you to challenge twisted logic and confront pathological reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d46ed7cc0adf03bc410427323c93738c.poster.avif?t=1766400754\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d46ed7cc0adf03bc410427323c93738c.webm?t=1766400754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/extras/d46ed7cc0adf03bc410427323c93738c.mp4?t=1766400754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PHOSEPO"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3432860/33e3be2e4a8757667a6d1faa894ab7ec954c6c01/header.jpg?t=1766400754","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Made possible with the support of GameWorks Ventures CO., LTD.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movi